      <transcript>MAHA-A</transcript>
      <definition>[=max-a, S. maha] adj. Great.</definition>
      <page>522</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠠᠾᠠ᠎ᠠ ᠺᠠᠯᠠ = ᠶᠡᠺᠡ ᠬᠠᠷᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- kala == jeke xara </transcript>
          <definition> The &apos;Great Black One&apos;, them  ost popular of the eight &apos;terrible divinities&apos;, or protectors of the faith, formerly worshiped as the special protector of the Mongols</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
